{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/排山倒海大巴掌","pageid":5701,"revid":17299,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%80%92%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%8E%8C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%80%92%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%8E%8C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8E%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%80%92%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%8E%8C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>排山倒海大巴掌</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8E.92.E5.B1.B1.E5.80.92.E6.B5.B7.E5.A4.A7.E5.B7.B4.E6.8E.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"排山倒海大巴掌\"><b>排山倒海大巴掌</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 排山倒海大巴掌.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/1mfkwbu9phxl3i4nvzahiuas5lt6oge.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%8E%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%80%92%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%8E%8C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/1mfkwbu9phxl3i4nvzahiuas5lt6oge.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%8E%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%80%92%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%B4%E6%8E%8C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8c/1mfkwbu9phxl3i4nvzahiuas5lt6oge.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />排山倒海大巴掌\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>4X3内\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对前方<font color=\"#ed7950\">3*4</font>区域内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">70%</font>范围伤害，攻并施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×受治疗</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；再击退每列首名敌人<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。本技能对免疫击退的目标，技能倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"严肃点！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">严肃点！</font></span></span>]时，技能倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4十字 4X3内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/62/moif53oqt6gglj9gli37xanewb0520e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_4X3%E5%86%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/62/moif53oqt6gglj9gli37xanewb0520e.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"大锤,该动真格啦！\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A7%E9%94%A4,%E8%AF%A5%E5%8A%A8%E7%9C%9F%E6%A0%BC%E5%95%A6%EF%BC%81\" title=\"技能图鉴库/大锤,该动真格啦！\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.